<section class="about-sanctuary" style="padding: 120px 0; background-color: var(--color-earth-dark); color: white; overflow: hidden;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;">
      
      <div class="sanctuary-content" data-aos="fade-right">
        <h2 class="h2" style="color: var(--color-gold); margin-bottom: 30px;">Not a Shed. A Sanctuary.</h2>
        <p class="p-large" style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 24px; font-style: italic;">
          "Our cows don't live in sheds. They live in the forest. We don't use hormones. We use love and ancient Vedic care."
        </p>
        <div style="margin-top: 40px; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold); padding-left: 30px; opacity: 0.8;">
          <p>Every Kapila cow in our care is treated as family. We follow the 'Ahinsa' (non-violent) method, ensuring the calf is well-fed before we take any milk for Ghee. This respect for life is what makes our Ghee a true elixir.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sanctuary-image" data-aos="fade-left">
        <div style="position: relative; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
          <img src="{{ 'about-sanctuary-bg.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Sacred Bond with Kapila Cow" style="width: 100%; display: block;">
          <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.4), transparent);"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Sanctuary",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "About Sanctuary"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
